{#- The ended work as subconscious/work_line.build_payload prepares it: purpose (the work's full objective), tasks
    [{title, status, outcome, at}] (outcome: the finalizer's account, or none when the task was not judged), ended
    {status, at, reason}. Times are UTC ISO, shown local. -#}
{%- set A = agent_input -%}
## What the work was for
{{ A.purpose }}

## Its tasks
{% for t in A.tasks -%}
- "{{ t.title }}": {% if t.outcome %}{{ t.outcome }} ({{ t.at | local_time }}){% else %}not run; {{ t.status }} when the work ended{% endif %}
{% else -%}
(none)
{% endfor %}
## How it ended
{{ A.ended.status }} at {{ A.ended.at | local_time }}{% if A.ended.reason %}: {{ A.ended.reason }}{% endif %}
{% if A.get('correction') %}
## Correct your previous answer

It did not satisfy the contract: {{ A.correction }}
{% endif %}
Write the line this work is known by.
